    "text": "……かっこいいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0113",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1700
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "！？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040010,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、プロデューサー\r\nずいぶん驚いた顔をしているね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "006",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、今日は来る予定なかったよな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040020,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、今日はアナタに話が──……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040020"
  },
  {
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ\r\nこの雑誌の中の私はどうだった？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "006",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………………………\r\n…………かっこよかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『王子』『咲耶様』って言われるのも納得だ\r\n咲耶は、求められるものに完璧に応えていた",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "きっとモデルを続けていたとしても、\r\n咲耶はトップを極められただろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……求められるもの……か",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだね、モデルだった頃の私は、\r\nこういったイメージを求められることが多かった",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……ほとんど、だったかな",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "オーディションなんて、\r\nアイドルになるまであまり受けなかったよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私に求められるイメージは、いつも似ていて\r\n新しいイメージを得るために挑戦することもなかったから",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "それでもずっと仕事をもらえていたのは、\r\nモデルの頃の事務所に感謝しないといけないね",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──ああもちろん、悪いものではなかったんだ\r\n私のことを好きになってくれるのは嬉しいことだし──",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "モデルにならなければ生まれなかった繋がりは山ほどある\r\nあの頃の私を、決して否定したくはないんだ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──けれど……やはり……\r\n私は…………",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……私は、それだけでは……寂しかった",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私はもっと気安く接してほしい\r\nみんなと一緒に、普通に笑っている方が、楽しいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタに出会ったのは、そんな時だった",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺か……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ\r\nあの時も、雑誌の撮影をしていただろう？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "もちろん、いつも求められるような雰囲気でいたはずだよ\r\n──だけどアナタは、私をアイドルとしてスカウトした",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、驚いたなんてものじゃない",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アイドルなんて、\r\n可愛い女の子だけがなれるものと思っていたし──",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私を見て、その素質があるなんて\r\n冗談でも言っているのかと戸惑ったくらいだ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あの時は、\r\n原石を見つけたと思って興奮してたから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、それは嬉しい言葉だ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040220"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bg": "00224",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 4000
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──……私も、変われるかも、と",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタの言葉に、そう思ったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040240"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "近寄りがたい存在の『咲耶様』から、\r\n親しみやすい『白瀬咲耶』に、変われるかもと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040250"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そしてアナタは、本当に魔法使いだった\r\n私の人生を、大きく変えてくれたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "恋鐘に、摩美々に、結華に、霧子に、事務所のみんなに\r\n──そして、ファンのみんなに",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "アナタは、出会わせてくれた",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "本当に、涙が出るほど嬉しくて、\r\n嬉しくて、嬉しくて──",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "fade_out",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040300,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私は、かつての私を、そしてかつての私を好きで\r\nいてくれた人を捨てたのだということに、気付いてなかった",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040310,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "理解していたつもりだったんだ\r\n私はモデルを辞めるのだと、私はもうアイドルなのだと",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "0051",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040310"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040320,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "けど……\r\nきっと本当の意味では、何も理解できていなかった",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040320"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040330,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だって、道は続いているものだと思っていたから",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040330"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040340,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "モデルでも、アイドルでも──\r\n私は変わらない、白瀬咲耶なのだと",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040340"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040350,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私が白瀬咲耶である限り……\r\n──本質のところは、何も変わらないのだと",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040350"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040360,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だけど…………\r\n私は何をすべきか、わからなくなった",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600304/1006003040360"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003040370,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "何をすれば、誰も悲しませないのか\r\n全ての人を喜ばせることが出来るのか──",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
